57 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 39 0 R/E(Feeling stressed as a mom is common, but did you know that hormone imbalances could be making it worse? When your body's hormones, like cortisol and adrenaline, get out of whack, it can throw your stress levels into overdrive. You might find yourself feeling more anxious, overwhelmed, or even irritable. )/Pg 11 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

58 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 39 0 R/E(These fluctuations can make it challenging to cope with the demands of motherhood, leaving you feeling exhausted and on edge.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

59 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 39 0 R/T(Understanding how hormone imbalances affect your stress levels is crucial for finding effective relief. When your hormones are imbalanced, it can feel like you're constantly battling against a tidal wave of stress. Simple tasks may seem daunting, and you might struggle to find moments of peace amidst the chaos of daily life. By recognizing the role hormones play in your stress levels, you can start to take steps to regain control and find relief.)/E(Understanding how hormone imbalances affect your stress levels is crucial for finding effective relief. When your hormones are imbalanced, it can feel like you're constantly battling against a tidal wave of stress. Simple tasks may seem daunting, and you might struggle to find moments of peace amidst the chaos of daily life. By recognizing the role hormones play in your stress levels, you can start to take steps to regain control and find relief.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

60 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 39 0 R/T(Fortunately, there are quick and easy techniques you can incorporate into your daily routine to help alleviate stress, even when hormone imbalances are at play. )/E(Fortunately, there are quick and easy techniques you can incorporate into your daily routine to help alleviate stress, even when hormone imbalances are at play. )/Pg 11 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

61 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 39 0 R/T(By prioritizing your well-being and making time for these simple practices, you can begin to rebalance your hormones and reclaim a sense of calm amidst the busyness of motherhood.)/E(By prioritizing your well-being and making time for these simple practices, you can begin to rebalance your hormones and reclaim a sense of calm amidst the busyness of motherhood.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

